/** Mounts a widget: at once when the page has what it needs (the player, its examples' data and
 * widgets.css in its head, as widgets/README.md asks), else once the widget has loaded them
 * itself — the player first, then the data —, with a line in its place meanwhile. A file that
 * does not load leaves the site's notice, naming it. */
